    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} swallows a [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=IPD9mDjKJEXc2uMQ]] target it is grappling. While swallowed, the target isn't Grappled but has the &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] and &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] conditions, and it has &amp;Reference[Total Cover] against attacks and other effects outside the frog.</p><p>While swallowing the target, the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can't use Bite, and if the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} dies, the swallowed target is no longer Restrained and can escape from the corpse using 5 feet of movement, exiting with the &amp;Reference[Prone apply=false] condition.</p><p>At the end of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s next turn, the swallowed target takes [[/damage 2d4 acid average]] damage. If that damage doesn't kill it, the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} disgorges it, causing it to exit &amp;Reference[Prone apply=false].</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: A Small or smaller creature the frog grapples is swallowed: Blinded, Restrained and with Total Cover. At the end of the frog's next turn it takes the acid damage and, if it survives, is disgorged, prone. If the frog drops to 0 hit points it gets out, prone.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
